object ContinuityTab: TTabItem
Text = 'Rename review'
object ContinuityPurpose: TLabel
Align = Top
Height = 90
Margins.Left = 12
Margins.Right = 12
WordWrap = True
Text = 'Review missing or renamed objects with linked knowledge. Click Find candidates, then select a proposed replacement. Inspect its Explain and Source views. Enter your reviewer name and approve only after establishing that it is the same logical object. Historical links and authored revisions are retained; knowledge content still needs separate review. Proposals never approve themselves.'
end
